<title>BELGIUM: TABLE-Belgian 1sr quarter GDP rises 2.3 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Belgian 1sr quarter GDP rises 2.3 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Belgian central bank gave the following estimates of gross domestic product in its weekly economic indicators statement -</p>
<p>GDP (in percent)</p>
<p>		 Q1 1997   Q4 1996   Q3 1996   Q2 1996   Q1 1996</p>
<p> qtr-on-qtr   1.1	 2.6	 1.5	 4.2	 0.1</p>
<p> yr-on-yr     2.3	 2.1	 1.9	 1.5	 0.4</p>
<p>NOTE -quarterly data seasonally adjusted; r = revised.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
